            <div xml:id="d328">

                <pb facs="0551" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.5914/53½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Wilson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 28, 1915</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: I enclose for your
                    information a memorandum of an interview which I had yesterday with the Danish
                    Minister. My own belief is that Denmark will come to the figure of $20,000,000
                    and that it will be possible to negotiate a treaty of cession with that amount
                    as a consideration. I will advise you in case I hear further from the Danish
                    Minister or from Mr. Egan.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d328-a1.xml" xpointer="d328-a1"/>
            </div>
